    },
    {
      "text": "Tan Bi Ya and Dong Fang Chang Fan discuss Dong Fang Yu Liang, Hei Lou Lan, Ye Lui Sang, and Ma tribe. Dong Fang Chang Fan opens the door of the blessed land when Tan Bi Ya leaves.",
      "chapters": [
