    {
      "text": "Looking at the battle coming to an end, in Ni Yu blessed land Dong Fang Chang Fan retracts his gaze and collects the smoke on the table into his sleeves.",
      "chapters": [
        515
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "watching-the-battle-end",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A long jade-layered walkway runs along a lake surface toward a pavilion, with light rain and soothing wind outside. Different from the outside world, the rain here falls from bottom to top, and the name Ni Yu came from this. After Tan Bi Ya, Hei Bai arrives as a new guest and pays respect to Dong Fang Chang Fan. Dong Fang Chang Fan shows colorful smoke of the real-time battle in Cao Fu, and later receives Hei Bai’s list of resources for Dong Fang tribe’s redemption after defeat.",
      "chapters": [
        519
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reverse-rain-and-guests",
